<title>UK: SEK sets $350 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>SEK sets $350 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AB SVENSK EXPORTKREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    $350 MLN	COUPON     6.01	MATURITY    19.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.13     PAY DATE    19.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG	 YES     CRS DEFLT   YES	FORCE MAJ  IPMA (2)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
